 windowtext;\">13%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Stomach</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">29%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Pancreas</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">11&ndash;36%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">32&ndash;54%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Uterus</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">9%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Ovary</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">21%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cervix</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">10%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Testis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">9%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lung</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">7&ndash;17%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
