    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;10.13</strong> Summary of the main features of Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Jansen M",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 467.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"623\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Feature</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Syndrome characteristic</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Syndrome MIM number(s) </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">175200</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated malignant tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal adenocarcinoma, gastric adenocarcinoma, pancreatic adenocarcinoma, breast cancer (see <span class=\"ID-File\">&lt;&lt;#48430&gt;&gt;</span>Table&nbsp;10.12)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Gastrointestinal hamartomatous polyps, ovarian sex cord tumour with annular tubules, Sertoli cell tumours of the testis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cancer-related inheritance </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Autosomal dominant</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>STK11 </em>(19p13)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">The STK11 (LKB1) pathway has multiple downstream targets including the WNT/TGF-&beta; and MAPK pathways</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
